  id: primitivetools
  displayName: Tools of the Clearing
  description: 'Bare hands bring berries home. A hatchet and a pick bring hardwood and ore. Bind a sharp rock to a stick for each: both are made from your bag ({key:Items}), from sticks and small rocks off the clearing floor.'
  chain: The First Days
  journalNotes: Stone tools are made from your bag ({key:Items}), with no station needed, and go on your belt by themselves. Without them a raid still brings people and loose finds home, but no wood and no ore.
